        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Royal’s Gambit</i> is a retro-inspired, turn-based card strategy game where every decision counts. Face off against intricate 16-card stage patterns made of powerful royal face cards standing in your way. To clear a path to the exit, you'll need to match card values to their health—planning carefully with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and refine your deck as you advance, unlocking new tools and strategies to overcome tougher stages. Each choice impacts your score, which rises with smart plays, combos, and risk-reward multipliers. But beware—failure means starting over, making every run a high-stakes gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes and over 80 unique stages, <i>Royal’s Gambit</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt on the fly, and master the board in pursuit of the perfect run—all presented with nostalgic pixel visuals and stylized retro effects.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Royal’s Gambit</i> is a retro-inspired, turn-based card strategy game where every decision counts. Face off against intricate 16-card stage patterns made of powerful royal face cards standing in your way. To clear a path to the exit, you'll need to match card values to their health—planning carefully with every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and refine your deck as you advance, unlocking new tools and strategies to overcome tougher stages. Each choice impacts your score, which rises with smart plays, combos, and risk-reward multipliers. But beware—failure means starting over, making every run a high-stakes gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple game modes and over 80 unique stages, <i>Royal’s Gambit</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt on the fly, and master the board in pursuit of the perfect run—all presented with nostalgic pixel visuals and stylized retro effects.</p>",
        "short_description": "Royal’s Gambit is a retro-style, turn-based card strategy game. Battle through 80+ stages of face card patterns by playing cards equal to their health, build your deck, boost your score with smart plays, and survive multiple modes—or start over from the beginning.",
